  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Malawi Growth Accelerator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Growth Accelerator is to provide growth capital and technical advice to Malawian startup companies. Capital is provided through matching grants of between 10,000 and 40,000 USD, or an equity investment of the same magnitude. Technical advice is provided by the Kenya-based accelerator Growth Africa, in cooperation with the Malawian startup hub mHub.</narrative>
  </description>
